{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-medicine","title":"临床医学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine","introMarkdown":"# 临床医学 简介\n\n临床医学是以诊断和治疗人类疾病为核心任务的应用学科，它建立在基础医学的理论根基之上，通过系统的临床训练将医学知识转化为救治患者的实际能力。从人体解剖的精确认知到疾病发生机制的深入理解，从体格检查的基本手法到影像学的判读技巧，临床医学构建了一套从认识人体到应对疾病的完整知识体系。\n\n自学者进入临床医学领域时需要意识到，这门学科的知识量极为庞大，但其内在逻辑是清晰的：基础医学解释\"人体如何运作\"和\"疾病如何发生\"，临床学科则回答\"如何识别疾病\"和\"如何治疗疾病\"。理解这种从基础到临床的逻辑链条，是避免陷入碎片化记忆的关键。同时需要强调，本课程旨在建立医学认知框架，不构成任何临床诊疗指导。\n\n第一章**基础医学**从人体解剖学出发，结合病理学和药理学的基本知识，建立对正常人体结构、疾病发生机制和药物作用原理的系统认知。第二章**内科学**介绍心血管、呼吸和消化系统等主要内科疾病的病因、诊断和治疗原则，展示内科临床思维的基本方法。第三章**外科学**涵盖普通外科和骨科的基本概念以及外科手术的基本原则，理解手术治疗的适应证和决策逻辑。第四章**诊断学**介绍体格检查、实验室检验和医学影像等基本诊断方法，这是从症状到诊断的桥梁。\n\n建议以器官系统为线索组织学习——比如学完心脏的解剖后，接着学心脏的病理生理，再学心血管内科和心脏外科——这种纵向整合的学习方式比按学科分割更有助于建立完整的临床思维。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-medicine","title":"基础医学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/basic-medicine","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"human-anatomy","title":"大学临床医学 — 人体解剖学","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/basic-medicine/human-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"physiology","title":"大学临床医学 — 生理学","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/basic-medicine/physiology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pathology","title":"大学临床医学 — 病理学","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/basic-medicine/pathology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"internal-medicine","title":"内科学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cardiovascular-diseases","title":"大学临床医学 — 心血管疾病","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/cardiovascular-diseases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"respiratory-diseases","title":"大学临床医学 — 呼吸系统疾病","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/respiratory-diseases"},{"seq":3,"slug":"endocrine-metabolic","title":"大学临床医学 — 内分泌与代谢疾病","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/endocrine-metabolic"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"surgery","title":"外科学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"surgical-principles","title":"大学临床医学 — 外科学总论","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/surgical-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"orthopedic-surgery","title":"大学临床医学 — 骨科学","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/orthopedic-surgery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"neurosurgery","title":"大学临床医学 — 神经外科","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/neurosurgery"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"diagnostics","title":"诊断学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-examination","title":"大学临床医学 — 体格检查","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/physical-examination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"laboratory-diagnostics","title":"大学临床医学 — 实验室诊断","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/laboratory-diagnostics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"medical-imaging","title":"大学临床医学 — 医学影像学","url":"/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/medical-imaging"}]}]}